+## Independent QA
+
+An independent, read-only QA pass (separate agent, no worktree edits, no cmake/build) verified seven checks,
+all PASS:
+
+1. The working tree's `scheduleStateReportsUtf8Bytes` has `toDouble` on both `source_bytes` reads and no
