+| RED build | `cmake --build build --target ControlShutdownHookTest` | 0 | `build-1-red-compile.log` |
+| RED run | `cd build/tests && ctest -R '^ControlShutdownHookTest$' --output-on-failure` | **8** | `test-1-red.log` |
