+| Real Windows CMake | `PATH="$TMPD/bin:$PATH" TMPDIR="$TMPD" python3 tests/vcpkg-pcre2-gitlink-test.py` (wrapper runs the Windows `cmake.exe` under wine) | `0` (all checks PASS) |
+| Rebuild | `cmake --build build --target zene` | `0` |
