+- **Cause and completeness:** the cause is the text-mode `file(WRITE)` at
+  `portfile.cmake:8` (pre-fix). All three callers of `zene_pcre2_patch` still
+  receive byte-identical patches; the `@ONLY` flag preserves the literal
